    "title": "Arkansas Secretary of State runoff election set for late-March - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rachel Rudd ,\n10 hours ago Craighead County, AR – JonesboroRightNow.com – Early voting for the Arkansas Secretary of State runoff is set to begin soon. The race is between state Sen. Kim Hammer (R-Benton) and Bryan Norris. During the Republican preferential primary, Hammer, Norris, and Miller County Judge Cathy Hardin Harrison ran for the seat, but no candidate secured a majority vote. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
